    + "<p>The task below has crossed its SLA of <strong>" + slaHours + " hours</strong> and is still pending with you:</p>"
    + "<table style='border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; max-width: 650px; border: 1px solid #ccc;'>"
    + "<tr><td " + td1 + ">Record ID</td><td " + td2 + ">" + recordId + "</td></tr>"
